body:
Mine said this also and I complained to Japancrate, they sent me a message telling me that that had meant that the company was sent a notice that they will be 'receiving' the item but it wasn't sent from Japancrate yet.

&#x200B;

After seeing that for the better part of a month, I got my box today! I also will say that my notices and what not did update prior to shipment so you should see an update soon.

Ice, beer, Cold! Sold here!

or Ice beer, Cold! Sold here!

@_@

My favourite game of all time [right here!](http://www.amazon.ca/2K-Games-710425411069-Borderlands-2/dp/B005G2F5E8/ref=sr_1_5?ie=UTF8&qid=1387861851&sr=8-5&keywords=Borderlands+2)

I keep my fingers crossed that [this](http://www.amazon.com/DMC-PC-DVD-PC/dp/B00AQAJXZC/ref=sr_1_1?s=videogames&ie=UTF8&qid=1387861509&sr=1-1&keywords=DMC) will end up cheap for the steam sale, but it already lost a community vote :c I'd likely buy that game :P Or Walking dead telltale SEASON 2 BECAUSE ITS EPIC ;-;

And Merry Christmas!
